================================================================================
PyXRD
================================================================================

MudLab is based on PyXRD (https://github.com/mathijs-dumon/PyXRD), originally
written by Mathijs Dumon, and has been substantially modified and extended as
MudLab by Parthasarathi Ghosh. The parts of MudLab derived from PyXRD are also
covered by PyXRD's licence, whose notice is reproduced below as PyXRD publishes
it. That licence also places PyXRD's mvc module under the GNU LGPL 2; the mvc
module is not part of MudLab.

